       "text": " adds validation logic that is applied when OCFL objects are reindexed. A subset of this logic, `HeadersValidator`, should be applied to resource headers as part of the normal operation of Fedora to ensure that does not produce or interact with corrupt objects.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
